#X text 280 884 o1 \, 2048 samples: the waveform at fast tau, f 34;
#N canvas 40 60 1100 560 voices 0;
#X text 20 10 Two ways to listen. DIRECT: o1 itself \, centred (minus 0.5) - audible when tau is small (fast). AS A CONTROLLER: o1 sets the pitch (MIDI 48..72) and o2 the loudness of a sine - useful when tau is large (slow)., f 140;
